
% Gone, Gone, Gone

In: I |
link: I |
outro: I |
a: I | V | vi | IV |
Vr: I | V | vi | IV |
b: IV | I | V |
PCh: $b*2
c: IV . . I | vi . . V |
Ch: $c*4
turnaround: R |
d: vi | I | IV | V |
bridge: $d*2 $c*4
PostCh: R |
S: [G] $In $Vr*2 $PCh $turnaround $Ch $turnaround $link $Vr $PCh $turnaround $Ch $turnaround $bridge $Ch*2 $PostCh $outro
